# Sensitive paths: one glob per line. The `policy` job of CI puts `needs-owner-ok`
# on the PR that touches any of them, and close-phase.sh --merge refuses without
# the repo owner's ok. `**` matches any number of folders.
**/auth/**
**/billing/**
**/payments/**
db/migrations/**
**/migrations/**
.env*
**/.env*
**/secrets/**
**/credentials/**
infra/production/**
# Dependencies and lockfiles
package-lock.json
**/package-lock.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
yarn.lock
**/yarn.lock
poetry.lock
uv.lock
requirements*.txt
Gemfile.lock
go.sum
Cargo.lock
# Gate: deploy workflows and the phase close
.github/workflows/deploy-*.yml
scripts/close-phase.sh
